# Beam check

```calc {#r1 x=0 y=37}
L := 6 m
```

```calc {#r2 x=0 y=55}
q := 12 kN/m
E := 210 GPa
I := 8360 cm^4
W_el := 557 cm^3
f_y := 355 MPa
```

```calc {#r3 x=0 y=151}
M_max := q*L^2/8 = ?   #= 54 kN*m
V_max := q*L/2 = ?     #= 36 kN
```

```calc {#r4 x=0 y=216}
σ := M_max/W_el = ? MPa   #= 96.948 MPa
U := σ/f_y = ?            #= 0.273
```

```calc {#r5 x=0 y=281}
δ := 5*q*L^4/(384*E*I) = ?   #= 11.535 mm
δ_allow := L/360 = ?         #= 16.667 mm
```

```calc {#r6 x=0 y=343}
check := if(δ <= δ_allow, "OK", "too flexible") = ?   #= "OK"
```

```calc {#r7 x=0 y=365}
M(x) := q*x*(L - x)/2
M(1.5 m) = ?   #= 40.5 kN*m
M(L/2) = ?     #= 54 kN*m
```

```plot {#p1 x=0 y=446}
title: Bending moment
x: x = 0 m .. L
x_unit: m
traces:
  - y: M(x)
    unit: kN*m
    label: M
```
